#About
I am a Security Operations Center (SOC) Analyst and Penetration Tester with 2+ years of experience identifying, investigating, and mitigating threats across enterprise, cloud, and hybrid environments. My background spans both offensive security (red-team) and defensive operations (blue-team), allowing me to assess risks holistically and strengthen overall security posture.

I specialize in SIEM monitoring (Splunk, QRadar), threat hunting, incident response, penetration testing, vulnerability management, and EDR analysis using tools like CrowdStrike Falcon and Microsoft Defender. My work has contributed to measurable improvements in detection accuracy, reduced false positives, and accelerated incident containment.

